      &END TOPOLOGY
      &COORD
         H         1.4778599991        2.0267400013       -1.4779200025
         H        -0.7590899976        0.2297599976        2.9308700004
         C        -1.7265399975       -1.3263500019       -0.8288600019
         B         1.1353400004       -0.4699000019       -1.1884899985
